          "author": "Joanna Cole and Bruce Degen",
          "description": "The classroom is decorated as Dinosaur Land, but Ms. Frizzle—inspired by an archeological dig—craves a more authentic experience. The Magic School Bus turns into a time machine and transports the class back millions of years to an adventure where they learn about dinosaurs, their habitats and diets, and even a Maiasaura nesting ground.",
